  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><div class=\"bg-off-white py-12\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-0\">Articles</h1><span class=\"text-neutral-400 block mt-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto\">Texts written by the Bidders Highway team.</span></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 mb-8\"><nav class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-8\"><a href=\"/en/posts\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors bg-neutral-900 text-white border-neutral-900\">All</a><a href=\"/en/posts?tag=collections\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors bg-stone-100 text-stone-700 border-stone-300 hover:bg-stone-200\">Collections</a><a href=\"/en/posts?tag=event\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 border-amber-300 hover:bg-amber-100\">Event</a><a href=\"/en/posts?tag=jacobs_takes\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors bg-sky-50 text-sky-800 border-sky-300 hover:bg-sky-100\">Jacob's takes</a><a href=\"/en/posts?tag=guides\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 border-emerald-300 hover:bg-emerald-100\">Guides</a><a href=\"/en/posts?tag=our_cars\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors bg-rose-50 text-rose-800 border-rose-300 hover:bg-rose-100\">Our cars</a><a href=\"/en/posts?tag=featured_cars\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors bg-violet-50 text-violet-800 border-violet-300 hover:bg-violet-100\">Featured cars</a></nav><ul class=\"md:grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 gap-y-8 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 mb-8 mt-8 xl:grid-cols-3!\"><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/welcome-fredrik\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/1d587fad6321a14f86c1c48af4567d8a\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"Welcome Fredrik!\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">31 Mar 12:30</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">Welcome Fredrik!</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">Let us introduce the newest addition to the editorial team, Fredrik Johansson, at Bidders Highway...</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/an-exciting-broadening-of-our-range\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/6bb8ebd2eb0344434bdd415a03896348\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"An exciting broadening of our range\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">28 Mar 12:35</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">An exciting broadening of our range</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">More horsepower as Bidders Highway welcomes race cars and enthusiast builds!</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/tip-us-off-and-earn-money\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/2a4adfaabcfabb4cb6068f8423b7e9c3\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"Tip us off and earn money!\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">22 Mar 15:00</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">Tip us off and earn money!</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">We're launching the \"Tip Line\"! A way for you to earn some cash on cars or motorcycles that you tip us off about and that are subsequentl...</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/reduced-fee-on-items-under-100000-sek\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/3a66b244e5e43f2f294a29a95d9e5102\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"Reduced fee on items under 100,000 SEK!\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">13 Mar 14:45</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">Reduced fee on items under 100,000 SEK!</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">Even better terms with a lower fee!</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/were-celebrating-our-1st-anniversary-today\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/110e10bc8286c71b6183dfdd5d8b7853\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"We're celebrating our 1st anniversary today!\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">01 Mar 14:10</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">We're celebrating our 1st anniversary today!</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">A huge thank you to our customers, followers, readers and the team behind Bidders Highway!</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/speed-weekend-arsunda-2023\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/9022bb7f2929d8cd16d19d139a84a9ee\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"Speed Weekend Årsunda 2023\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">28 Feb 16:05</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">Speed Weekend Årsunda 2023</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">The event for those who love wide stances and speed!</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/spring-airing\" class=\"transition-colors hover:t